sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(20,24,30) User Machine
        participant callback as Callback
        participant app as App
        participant browser as Browser<br>(User Agent)
    end
    box rgb(20,24,30) ESS
        participant idp as IdP
        participant backend as SciCat BE
    end

    rect rgb(118,51,51)
    note right of app: OAuth 2.0 w/ PKCE
    app->>app: Gen challenge + verifier
    app-->+callback:Open
    app->>browser:Open URL w/ challenge + redirect
    browser->>idp:Request login w/ challenge + redirect
    idp->>idp:Store challenge
    idp->>browser:Request credentials or session token
    browser->>idp:Supply credentials or session token
    idp->>browser:Return redirect + auth code
    browser->>callback:Redirect w/ auth code
    app->callback:Store auth code
    callback-->-app:Close
    app->>idp:Request token w/ auth code + verifier
    idp->>app:Return access token
    end

   rect rgb(44,102,118)
   note right of app: Exchange for SciCat token
   app->>backend:Request SciCat JWT w/ Idp access token
   backend->>backend:Verify access token<br>using Idp pub key
   backend->>backend:Create SciCat JWT
   backend->>app:Return SciCat JWT
   end
